Brakka's story ends here, in the cold depths of the Old North Works. The town council will seal the mine at sunrise, and the missing miners — and Brakka — will remain lost in the dark.

If you wish to continue in this world, you may create a new character. Greyhollow, the temple, Hessa, the sealed mine — all of it remains. Perhaps another dwarf will take up the oath, or perhaps someone else entirely will come to Greyhollow, drawn by rumors of lights that walk in the deep places.

